  "prefLabel": "Bcr 215.06 Transcripts from Licensing Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 215.06 Transcripts from Licensing Board. The licensing board shall supply the board a certified copy of the record and a transcribed copy of the testimony at the licensing board’s expense at least 5 days prior to any scheduled hearing or within the timeframe as directed by the board.\n\nSource. #8323, eff 4-12-05; ss by #10161, eff 7-13-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bcr200.html"
